				"from": 174700,
				"to": 180700
			},
			"text": "没有早点看牙 肯定是有牙兽疾病 但是没有任人去看牙 牙齿上至少卫生是不懂"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:00,700",
				"to": "00:03:04,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 180700,
				"to": 184700
			},
			"text": "这个牙齿很恐怖 因为这吊着不肯定"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:04,700",
				"to": "00:03:11,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 184700,
				"to": 191700
			},
			"text": "你就在吊着之后 你再装上那个牙齿 那个假牙的功能比你原来的牙齿差太多了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:11,700",
				"to": "00:03:16,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 191700,
				"to": 196700
			},
			"text": "所以我就讲这个 我们现在当六边形战士 你得所有东西都洗手"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:16,700",
				"to": "00:03:18,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 196700,
				"to": 198700
			},
			"text": "洗手 全方面提深認知"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:18,700",
				"to": "00:03:19,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 198700,
				"to": 199700
			},
			"text": "對吧"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:20,700",
				"to": "00:03:22,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 200700,
				"to": 202700
			},
			"text": "全方面非常同時"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:22,700",
				"to": "00:03:23,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 202700,
				"to": 203700
			},
			"text": "而且你不能覺得"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:23,700",
				"to": "00:03:24,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 203700,
				"to": 204700
			},
			"text": "老師覺得我是為神"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:24,700",
				"to": "00:03:25,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 204700,
				"to": 205700
			},
			"text": "我研究數學就行"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:25,700",
				"to": "00:03:27,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 205700,
				"to": 207700
			},
			"text": "那你牙齒全面的可能"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:27,700",
				"to": "00:03:28,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 207700,
				"to": 208700
			},
			"text": "給你帶來很多不變"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:28,700",
				"to": "00:03:29,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 208700,
				"to": 209700
			},
			"text": "對"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:29,700",
				"to": "00:03:30,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 209700,
				"to": 210700
			},
			"text": "不能傲慢"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:30,700",
				"to": "00:03:32,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 210700,
				"to": 212700
			},
			"text": "你就叫你一龍馬子"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:32,700",
				"to": "00:03:34,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 212700,
				"to": 214700
			},
			"text": "你帶來很多不變"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:34,700",
				"to": "00:03:36,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 214700,
				"to": 216700
			},
			"text": "你壽命會縮短"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:36,700",
				"to": "00:03:39,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 216700,
				"to": 219700
			},
			"text": "給你帶來很多不好的東西"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:39,700",
				"to": "00:03:41,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 219700,
				"to": 221700
			},
			"text": "也會拖慢你的數學進來"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:41,700",
				"to": "00:03:42,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 221700,
				"to": 222700
			},
			"text": "是不是"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:42,700",
				"to": "00:03:43,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 222700,
				"to": 223700
			},
			"text": "對"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:43,700",
				"to": "00:03:47,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 223700,
				"to": 227600
			},
			"text": "磨刀不物砍拆工 千万我们不要想说"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:47,600",
				"to": "00:03:50,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 227600,
				"to": 230700
			},
			"text": "我为了砍拆刀都不磨了 这绝对不行"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:50,700",
				"to": "00:03:52,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 230700,
				"to": 232700
			},
			"text": "所以我就觉得就是所有"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:52,700",
				"to": "00:03:54,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 232700,
				"to": 234700
			},
			"text": "你像比如说我都"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:54,700",
				"to": "00:03:57,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 234700,
				"to": 237500
			},
			"text": "后面为什么我提出主动健康管理的概念"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:57,500",
				"to": "00:03:59,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 237500,
				"to": 239700
			},
			"text": "很多有钱人都是老师觉得"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:59,700",
				"to": "00:04:00,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 239700,
				"to": 240700
			},
			"text": "我有钱"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:00,700",
				"to": "00:04:03,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 240700,
				"to": 243700
			},
			"text": "我就是要医生把我去提升售命"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:03,700",
				"to": "00:04:05,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 243700,
				"to": 245100
			},
			"text": "要医生把我去什么"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:05,100",
				"to": "00:04:07,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 245100,
				"to": 247900
			},
			"text": "这个气不对 你的健康率你自己要管的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:07,900",
				"to": "00:04:09,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 247900,
				"to": 249700
			},
			"text": "对不对 你说医生能干吗"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:09,700",
				"to": "00:04:12,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 249700,
				"to": 252700
			},
			"text": "每次冲进医院急救室的时候打喊说"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:12,700",
				"to": "00:04:15,260"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 252700,
				"to": 255260
			},
			"text": "不惜一切代价强就过来"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:16,020",
				"to": "00:04:17,980"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 256020,
				"to": 257980
			},
			"text": "那个时候都晚了 对吧"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:17,980",
				"to": "00:04:19,140"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 257980,
				"to": 259140
			},
			"text": "你早干嘛去了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:19,140",
				"to": "00:04:20,180"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 259140,
				"to": 260180
			},
			"text": "而且好多东西"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:20,180",
				"to": "00:04:21,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 260180,
				"to": 261940
			},
			"text": "你的健康这个事你自己干的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:21,940",
				"to": "00:04:23,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 261940,
				"to": 263620
			},
			"text": "你不能让别人管"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:23,620",
				"to": "00:04:25,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 263620,
				"to": 265300
			},
			"text": "因为健康这个东西"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:25,300",
				"to": "00:04:25,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 265300,
				"to": 265580
			},
			"text": "对吧"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:25,580",
				"to": "00:04:27,420"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 265580,
				"to": 267420
			},
			"text": "都都是你自己定的 对不对"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:27,420",
				"to": "00:04:29,420"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 267420,
				"to": 269420
			},
			"text": "你自己如果都没有一个主动"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:29,420",
				"to": "00:04:30,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 269420,
				"to": 270500
			},
			"text": "健康管理的概念"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:30,500",
				"to": "00:04:32,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 270500,
				"to": 272940
			},
			"text": "你还能让别人帮你去管健康吗"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:32,940",
				"to": "00:04:34,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 272940,
				"to": 274460
			},
			"text": "这个不靠谱"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:34,460",
				"to": "00:04:35,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 274460,
				"to": 275500
			},
			"text": "所以这个"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:35,500",
				"to": "00:04:36,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 275500,
				"to": 276780
			},
			"text": "所有这个东西"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:36,780",
				"to": "00:04:39,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 276780,
				"to": 279060
			},
			"text": "这个任职就是我是逐步迭代"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:39,060",
				"to": "00:04:40,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 279060,
				"to": 280060
			},
			"text": "逐步升级"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:40,060",
				"to": "00:04:41,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 280060,
				"to": 281500
			},
			"text": "就像你刚才讲的很对"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:41,500",
				"to": "00:04:46,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 281500,
				"to": 286880
			},
			"text": "就说认知信息本身就是决定智商的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:46,880",
				"to": "00:04:51,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 286880,
				"to": 291240
			},
			"text": "智商只是认知和信息的一个外险加班了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:51,240",
				"to": "00:04:52,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 291240,
				"to": 292780
			},
			"text": "对 对吧 对吧"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:52,780",
				"to": "00:04:55,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 292780,
				"to": 295780
			},
			"text": "现在就后来往流行这个显化显化"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:57,180",
				"to": "00:05:00,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 297180,
				"to": 300120
			},
			"text": "你的认知显化就是智商"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:00,620",
				"to": "00:05:03,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 300620,
				"to": 303880
			},
			"text": "而不是倒推好像是智商是个本质的东西"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:03,880",
				"to": "00:05:06,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 303880,
				"to": 306780
			},
			"text": "还是认知其实是更本质的东西"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:08,080",
				"to": "00:05:09,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 308080,
				"to": 309380
			},
			"text": "非常非常同意"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:09,380",
				"to": "00:05:12,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 309380,
				"to": 312780
			},
			"text": "这个版本要全方面升级做榴边形战势"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:12,780",
				"to": "00:05:14,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 312780,
				"to": 314580
			},
			"text": "关于Crypto这个话题"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:14,580",
				"to": "00:05:15,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 314580,
				"to": 315380
			},
			"text": "我想最后再问一下"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:15,380",
				"to": "00:05:18,980"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 315380,
				"to": 318980
			},
			"text": "这您认为"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:18,980",
				"to": "00:05:21,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 318980,
				"to": 321580
			},
			"text": "Crypto will eat the world"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:21,580",
				"to": "00:05:26,180"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 321580,
				"to": 326180
			},
			"text": "以及比特币将会是最终的价值出存吗"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:26,180",
				"to": "00:05:26,980"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 326180,
				"to": 326980
			},
			"text": "对我当同意"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:26,980",
				"to": "00:05:28,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 326980,
				"to": 328680
			},
			"text": "我当同意这观点"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:28,680",
				"to": "00:05:29,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 328680,
				"to": 329680
			},
			"text": "就是因为"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:29,680",
				"to": "00:05:33,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 329680,
				"to": 333880
			},
			"text": "我觉得就大家就是不用太想太多"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:33,880",
				"to": "00:05:37,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 333880,
				"to": 337580
			},
			"text": "就是因为比特币没有跟任何人扛屁的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:37,580",
				"to": "00:05:44,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 337580,
				"to": 344580
			},
			"text": "很多人就说比着币不好,比着币也没有跟你扛批的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:44,580",
				"to": "00:05:47,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 344580,
				"to": 347580
			},
			"text": "比着币跟谁扛批的呢?比着币跟黄金扛批的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:47,580",
				"to": "00:05:51,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 347580,
				"to": 351580
			},
			"text": "那黄金能扛批的应比着币吗?那不可能的吗?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:51,580",
				"to": "00:05:55,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 351580,
				"to": 355580
			},
			"text": "因为他跟比着币,比着币有的时候都没他,对不对?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:55,580",
				"to": "00:05:58,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 355580,
				"to": 358580
			},
			"text": "能扛批的应吗?扛批的不应"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:58,580",
				"to": "00:06:01,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 358580,
				"to": 361580
			},
			"text": "所以我觉得就是这个很简单的一个道理"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:01,580",
				"to": "00:06:05,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 361580,
				"to": 365580
			},
			"text": "对吧?包括这些东西,新的这些东西我都是很看好"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:05,580",
				"to": "00:06:09,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 365580,
				"to": 369740
			},
			"text": "為什麼呢?因為他躺屁的那個對象態是好"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:09,740",
				"to": "00:06:14,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 369740,
				"to": 374700
			},
			"text": "對吧?比他逼每個版本還升級呢?那黃金升級嗎?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:14,700",
				"to": "00:06:16,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 374700,
				"to": 376700
			},
			"text": "對吧?你要是買到黃金那邊"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:16,700",
				"to": "00:06:20,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 376700,
				"to": 380300
			},
			"text": "對吧?那個永遠不升級?那不幹嗎?沒有什麼?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:20,300",
				"to": "00:06:21,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 380300,
				"to": 381820
			},
			"text": "這個什麼呢?這個這個這個這個"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:21,820",
				"to": "00:06:24,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 381820,
				"to": 384700
			},
			"text": "蘇貴爾我們最講的就是一個版本"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:24,700",
				"to": "00:06:26,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 384700,
				"to": 386540
			},
			"text": "對吧?更版本"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:26,540",
				"to": "00:06:27,340"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 386540,
				"to": 387340
			},
			"text": "對不對?"
		}
	]
}
